---
source: tests/sync/write_cargo_toml.rs
expression: "apply(PKG, &patch)"
---
## Input

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"
```

## Patch

```
deps:
  - serde@1 features=["derive", "rc"]
```

## Output

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"

[dependencies]
serde = { version = "1", features = ["derive", "rc"] }
```
